{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"remote"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"deletedIDs"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The rows read from storage for the IDs in question. Rows for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"IDs the caller didn’t ask about are simply not here, and their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"absence means nothing.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"remote"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IDs storage reports as deleted elsewhere. Removed with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the same origin a full reconcile uses, so no deletion is recorded and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"none is echoed back to the store it came from. An ID that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"still holds is ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}]},{"text":" removed however it is named here: a live row","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is positive evidence, and a tombstone can be stale.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"deletedIDs"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"IDs the caller knows carry unflushed local intent, exactly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"as in the full reconcile. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"remote"},{"text":" has no authority over them, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"neither does ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"deletedIDs"},{"text":". This store’s own un-drained ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/changes","isActive":true},{"text":" are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"folded in automatically.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"preserving"}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The counterpart to ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","type":"reference"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"partial read — a refresh of the rows a sync tick reported as changed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rather than of the whole table. Absorbing rows works identically; what","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changes is where deletions come from.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A partial snapshot ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"cannot","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" infer deletion from absence. An ID missing","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from it was not deleted, it was not asked for, and treating the two alike","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"would empty the store on the first partial merge. So removal is driven","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"entirely by ","type":"text"},{"code":"deletedIDs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which the caller must have positive evidence","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for — a history tombstone, not an empty result.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" record changes — this is a hydration operation, for the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reason the full reconcile isn’t one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swidux"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV9reconcile4with8deleting10preservingyACyxG_Shy10Foundation4UUIDVGALtF","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"deleting"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">)"}],"title":"reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore\/reconcile(with:deleting:preserving:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux","doc:\/\/Swidux\/documentation\/Swidux\/EntityStore"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Reconciles this store against a snapshot covering only ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"some","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" of its IDs.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"references":{"doc://Swidux/documentation/Swidux/EntityStore/reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconciles this store against an authoritative snapshot from storage."}],"title":"reconcile(with:preserving:removingMissing:)","url":"\/documentation\/swidux\/entitystore\/reconcile(with:preserving:removingmissing:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"reconcile"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"with"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Swidux11EntityStoreV","text":"EntityStore"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Entity"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"preserving"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"removingMissing"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIden